local function CreateCompleteSilverSurferUI()
--[[
    SILVER SURFER UI  |  v1.13.29
    A single-file Roblox Luau interface framework in the spirit of Linoria:
    a compact, monospaced, bordered desktop panel -- rebuilt with a cleaner
    component model, deterministic layout, and a polished black + gold theme.

    LAYOUT MODEL
    Every groupbox lays its children out with a UIListLayout and uses
    AutomaticSize on the Y axis. Nothing is absolutely positioned against
    a sibling, so titles, wrapped labels, and controls can never overlap.

    API
